#: kristof_crosstrainer/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "CROSSTRAINER"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You're forced to crane your neck upwards as you try to take in the entirety of the blonde Viking towering over you. He stares down at you, cutting a truly intimidating figure."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He says nothing for several minutes—you begin to wonder if perhaps your cross-trainer is broken."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/37
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "AAAAAAUUUGGGHHHHHHHH!!!!!!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/66/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You ok?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/67/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow, you're big."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/68/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey there - that was some scream!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "What is \"oak hay\"? I am not an oak. And what do trees have to do with hay?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, no, it means are you alright. Ok means alright."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Ah. I see! You must be foreign. You speak strangely, but I'm willing not to kill you yet; we seem to be communicating."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, this is my house, so technically you're the foreign one."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Kill me?!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Ha! An excellent point! I suppose I must conquer you now!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not necessarily!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Conquer me? Never!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "No? Well, what other option is there?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We could just talk, or hang out. Get to know each other."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Tch. That sounds boring."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "What reason would I have to be here, and talk, and NOT try to conquer you?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, I guess you could think of yourself as my guest."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Your guest?! Odin defend me, how would I have fallen so far as to become a guest??"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Do you mean that neither one of us has conquered the other, we just decide not to kill each other because we'd rather eat and drink and TALK?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "This could only have occurred if I were no longer strong enough to TAKE hospitality instead of having it THRUST upon me like a mewling child!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whoa... I didn't know you'd feel that way... you can totally try to conquer me, if it would make you feel better."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Way to make me feel like a shitty host!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Oh, it would. Indeed it would! Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Don't fret... I frequently teach the science of violence; I can easily scale my skills so as not to decimate you too quickly."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-0/23
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Though with someone who is not a toddler, it is sickening to me to do so. Choose your weapon!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "...yes, yes, a shitty host! That's exactly what you are! shitty and... shit-ful, loaded with shit!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you trying to irritate me right now?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "No! Absolutely not. I am merely telling the truth, you... shite-monger!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, you are. You're trying to irritate me so I'll fight with you."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You have seen through my ruse. Clever... very clever."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, hell with it. You're not my guest, I guess you've got to try to conquer me now."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Excellent! Yes. We shall meet in battle and I shall EARN the hospitality you bestow upon me by whupping you!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You are indeed game for a good fight. I LOVE IT! Choose your weapon!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Of course! Would you not try to kill a stranger who woke you from a dream of battle with large-breasted opponents?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Murder wouldn't be my first instinct."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "When you put it that way... I just might."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Was the large-breasted part necessary?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "A shame. Why not?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't enjoy violence all that much."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd try to at least get to know you before I kill you."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Huh. You are most definitely foreign."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I love violence. Between violence and a strong dark ale..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Who am I kidding. They're both excellent! In fact, let's partake shall we?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "What a waste of time!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You get to know someone quite well through doing battle with them!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-1/23
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Come, I will show you."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Exactly. It is indeed great to understand each other. Would you now like me to try to kill you?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, definitely."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Um, no, I'm good for now, thanks."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Ha HA! Yes."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Oh come now, it will be grand! If you're nervous, I can use the same techniques I use on the baby equipment in my village."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You fight... babies?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Only to train them! An adult truly letting fly with a young one is a waste of perfectly good child-sized violence."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Now...."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "For that particular dream, yes. Perhaps you'd like me to elaborate!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hell yeah, tell me all about it!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-2/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Dear god, no."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-2/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Ah. Squeamish. Too bad! I have excellent descriptive skills. Very... sensory."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-2/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, then... sure!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-2/15/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sure you do. But maybe we could talk about something else?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-2/15/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Of course! No violence... no large-breasted powertrainers... hm."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-2/15/c-1/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You'd better pick something."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-2/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What are you most proud of?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Indeed I am! Big, brazen and bodacious."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, love the body positivity!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bodacious! Do you surf?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I am positive I have a body."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "And I am positive that everything about my body is positive. Godlike, truly."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "So yes! Body... positivity. I understand!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I am a genius."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Genius? Do you like your mind as much as you like your body?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Of course I do! To do otherwise would be illogical!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Are you accusing me of being illogical?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-0/23/0/s/0 kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-2/18/g-0/22/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I do!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You refute my accusation?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "How dare you! A viking prides himself on rationality!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "And when one demeans ones rationality - there is only one recourse - VIOLENCE!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Surf? No, I don't... what does that have to do with her? Stop talking nonsense or I shall kill you."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Her?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "But of course, Her. Queen Boadicea. Bodacious, indeed!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is that where that word comes from?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "For me it is, yes. Victorious! With an insatiable hunger for justice and a violent rebellion against authority outside my own."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What if you're wrong?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I'm not."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Are you calling me wrong?!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "We shall fight immediately if you are!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I was just wondering!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, yeah, maybe! You're just assuming."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Well, no matter, we shall fight anyway. I haven't had a melee in hours and I'm unbelievably bored."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-0/15 kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-0/23 kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/23 kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Choose your weapon!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I live in a reality that suits me, a reality I will defend with my life!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Besides, look at these glutes, I can ASSume just about anything I want."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The glutes are pretty good, gotta say."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your muscles don't give you the right to be presumptuous."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "They are, I know. I train them everyday to ensure they are always ready for violence."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "And of course for receiving admiration!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/23/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do many admire your glutes?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "But of course."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I do, on a daily basis."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Do you not constantly admire your own musculature?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh, no, honestly. Mine could use a little work."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All the time. I'm looking great!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-0/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Haven't really thought about it, I guess."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Could it, indeed."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "No time like the present, then. We shall train together today!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Confidence! I see you have it, too."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Let's celebrate our exceptional physical existences by doing battle!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-2/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Ah, well, of course, what you've said makes no sense to me at all, but I assume you're foreign, and therefore can be excused for strange behavior."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I think you'll find they do."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I'll challenge you, we shall fight, and after your defeat you'll find you're much more amenable to my opinions."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/23/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And what if I win?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I will definitely still be right..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "But IF you win, then you can be right, too! It's quite fun, you'll see."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Hay is for horses."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "And yes, it was a fine battle cry."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was just trying to be nice..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Nice, eh?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I don't know you and you don't know me and it does seems safer for you to be... polite."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/23/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Safer for me?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/23/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Yes. Safer. If you haven't noticed my rippling warrior's build, I invite you to inspect me more closely."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/23/c-0/23/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Peer very closely.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/23/c-0/23/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I see your... flywheel."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/23/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You take a good look at Kristof's rippling warrior's build. Him big."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/23/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Not that close! You assume intimacy where none is offered!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/23/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He puts his hands on his hips, thrusting his pelvis out proudly to give you a better look at the little wheel that sits at his groin."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/23/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Ah, yes, my flywheel! Glorious, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/23/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-1/26
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I'm not entirely sure what it's for, but if you aggravate me, we can figure it out together!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/23/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-1/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, I'll be sure not to aggravate you then!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/23/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-1/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ha! Right, like I'm going to be afraid of \"aggravating\" a jumped-up ski trainer."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/23/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-1/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "A wise decision! I may be only just recovering from a day of battle and a night of revelry..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/23/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-1/34/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "...but let us face facts."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/23/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-1/34/c-0/23
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I would win."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/23/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-1/34/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Probably. I'm not much of a fighter."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/23/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-1/34/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Ah. Well. We can fix that."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/23/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-1/34/c-0/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Skill is not the mark of a warrior... it is the heart. The willingness."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/23/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-1/34/c-0/31/c-0/23
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Let's fight, and we'll see where you are! Choose your weapon!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/23/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-1/34/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Good! No fear! I can work with that."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/23/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-1/34/c-1/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Let's stretch the legs and get to know each other, eh?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/waking_the_giant/0/c-2/23/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-1/34/c-1/23
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "A battle!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Excellent! Alright. I'm proud of how violent I am."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Should have guessed. Anything other than that?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Huh! Look at that!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Look at what?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...uh... I meant—"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Also my bulging pecs, my silken god-like locks, my deep and thunderous voice that sounds as though Odin was speaking to you through my perfectly formed mouth..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow. You have a very... healthy self-image!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you should put your modesty on the list."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Everything about me is healthy!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Ah! Thank you for the reminder. I'm proud of my honest self-assessment."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/g-1/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You have amazing self-confidence."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/g-1/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I get it. You like yourself."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I amaze myself atimes!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/g-1/c-4/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hope you can back up all this boasting."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/g-1/c-4/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Naturally I can. Where do you think I got the confidence in the first place? Come, let me show you!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I know. Wonderful, isn't it? I'm sure you do as well! From what I've seen here, you certainly should."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/g-1/c-5/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey, thanks. I'm... working on it."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/g-1/c-5/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh... I was kind of being a jerk, but I appreciate the compliment."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "That's fine, too. There is always room for improvement. Even if you're me!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Let us improve together!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/g-2/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/g-2/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not sure I want to..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Come come, we shall battle, of course!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Not to worry. I teach the way of violence to the babies in my village all the time."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/g-3/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I see nothing wrong with that statement!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/g-3/9/s/0 kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/c-0/23/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh god."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/g-3/c-8/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Why should you?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/g-3/c-8/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Now... to battle!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/g-3/c-9/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Just one? Pah!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/things_were_proud_of/0/g-3/c-9/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Let us battle over the multiplicity of my gods versus your puny one!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories/0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Hahaha, I shall! I shall, indeed."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories/0/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "As soon as you prove yourself worthy!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Worthy? How?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "By fighting me, of course! We do battle, we get bloody and sweaty, we have a good laugh, and then we tell stories until it's time to drink!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Um... Ok."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is my perfect day. Let's go."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battle_bots/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I feel it..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battle_bots/11
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "The surge of violence within me!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battle_bots/22
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Come to me at this place with your weapon - next we meet."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battle_bots/30
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "<w>AND GLORY SHALL BE MINE!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Well met, Combatant!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Did you choose your weapon well? Did you train for this match?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/16
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "We will fight. We will fight together, Odin, what a perfect day!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/24
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "What is your weapon??"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A soup spoon."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This piece of lint from my pocket."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "My dentist's last holiday card, duh."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Ah, a deceptively simple and versatile weapon. What will you do, huh? Scoop out my eyes? Bury a flaming chunk of peat moss in a hollow of my throat?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I thought I'd eat some soup."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Definitely eye-scooping."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "None of the above, I was trying to get you to let me out of this!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I see you are using the time-honored tactic of misdirection!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You leave an inviting bowl of soup plus spoon over here..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "While over there, you make off with all of my replacement cables and machine oil!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, no, I was actually just going to eat soup."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...yeah, that was totally my plan."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "But we're in battle."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, I know, I'm kinda hungry. I can make you some if you want."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Come on, have something! Eating is so much more fun than fighting."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I do not want soup."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/15/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You sure? It's from the fancy grocery store..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/15/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow are you gonna miss out. I make my soup with three kinds of onion."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "By Odin's beard..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I knew I had detected the spark of belligerent genius in you!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I rush to defend my stores, and now I face you, more enraged, more alight with battle-fire than ever!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I... would run away if I saw that, honestly."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was kidding. I really just wanted soup."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I would definitely kill you."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Yes! I love it. But how? Be specific!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/23/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Um... I hadn't thought that far ahead."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/23/c-2/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You mean you have no strategy. No plan."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/23/c-2/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "No plan, and because you have now used your spoon to distract me, you have no weapon."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/23/c-2/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...that's correct."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/23/c-2/15/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Damn Kristof - you got me."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Ah yes, excellent, it's one of my favorites I must admit."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "What a shame for you, I know the perfect counter-move!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Which is...?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can't wait to hear this one."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Why, a bear hug, of course! I pull you in tightly and completely defeat the advantage of your weapon!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Kristof scoops you into his arms, crushing you against his prominent pecs."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/19/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're hugging me."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/19/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ohhhhh-kay you're touching me, like a lot..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/19/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "That I am. It's part of your training!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/19/g-0/11
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "A warrior must always be ready for physical intimacy."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/19/g-0/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He holds you closer, lifting you just a bit so that your nose settles into the crook of his neck. This is... not the sort of violence you were expecting prior."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/19/g-0/27/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You kinda smell good..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/19/g-0/27/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Having my nose squished against your neck is not unpleasant..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/19/g-0/27/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Gak... stop!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/19/g-0/27/c-2/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "All right, all right fine."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/19/g-0/27/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I know. I smell of sweat. I smell of victory. I smell of manliness!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/19/g-0/27/g-0/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "It is my natural scent."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/19/g-0/27/g-0/16
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "It has lulled many an enemy into a swoon, and thereafter I of course destroy them."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/19/g-0/27/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Have you ever not destroyed them? What if you thought they kinda smelled good, too?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/19/g-0/27/g-0/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do warriors have to practice the martial art of lovemaking?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/19/g-0/27/g-0/24/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "There's time for all that later! Right now, we do violence!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/19/g-0/27/g-0/24/g-0/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "It would honor me, and make me less likely to kill you out of boredom, if you would focus."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/19/g-0/27/g-0/24/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd rather flirt than fight! I'm a warrior for love, man."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/19/g-0/27/g-0/24/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Right. Violence. Got it."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/19/g-0/27/g-0/24/g-0/16/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Excellent. Now. You are swooning, both of my eyes are intact in my head, I have you in a brutal yet pleasurable full-body embrace."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/19/g-0/27/g-0/24/g-0/16/c-1/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Choose your next move boldly!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/19/g-0/27/g-0/24/g-0/16/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I flail wildly and hope my fists do something useful."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/19/g-0/27/g-0/24/g-0/16/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I begin to moan and lament all the sunsets I never watched."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/19/g-0/27/g-0/24/g-0/16/c-1/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I faint and play dead."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/19/g-0/27/g-0/24/g-0/16/c-1/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "If you fainted, you wouldn't be playing dead at all. You'd almost be dead. Actually dead."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/g-0/19/g-0/27/g-0/24/g-0/16/c-1/23/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Huh, okay."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Faen! Why would you want to be let out of..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I tire of this nonsense!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/23
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Fight, in good faith!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's not that I don't want to learn, this is just a lot of pressure!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've never used a \"weapon\" in my life!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just don't want to hurt you, broski, that's what it is."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Aaahhh I see."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You are nervous! You are unsure about your ability to perform admirably in this situation."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-0/23
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I can't say I've ever experienced that, what would you call it, 'anxiety of performance', but I can understand."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "No better time to start, then!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Come come, choose something, anything!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ooh, breathing! Like exhaling really hard at you."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok ok... um... blinking. I choose blinking."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Yes! Wait... breathing?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-1/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You are going to fight me with your... breathing."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hell yes, I am. Prepare to be BLOWN away."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh yeah. I'm so good at breathing, watch this..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Blinking."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-1/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Like... with your eyes?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-1/23/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-1/23/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm already really comfortable doing it, so it's one less thing to learn. Right?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-2/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Ahaha HA! I relish the swagger, my fellow warrior, come at me!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-2/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I don't want to. I'll feel so bad if I hurt you."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-2/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't think you get it, I'm really scary."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-2/18/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "The likelihood that you will even inconvenience me is remote."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-2/18/g-0/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Now attack!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-2/18/g-0/22/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Leave me alone, man!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-2/18/g-0/22/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I don't understand... are you not reveling in the violence?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-2/18/g-0/22/g-0/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "A soup spoon is such an excellent tool for violence, I thought when you chose it..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-2/18/g-0/22/g-0/16
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I thought you must know its potential and therefore... enjoy it."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-2/18/g-0/22/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nope. I just don't feel like fighting right now, ok?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-2/18/g-0/22/g-0/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's a fine weapon. It's also a useful implement for eating soup."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-2/18/g-0/22/g-0/24/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's a fine weapon. It's also a useful implement for eating rice."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-0/15/c-2/31/c-2/18/g-0/22/g-0/24/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Did you just make a choice between 'eating soup' and 'eating rice'?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Lint. You mean that sticky, dusty substance that collects in the bottom of bags and body crevices?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yup. That's the stuff."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Exactly! Scary, right?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-1/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You're not even trying."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, I don't have ANY practice with this. Like I said."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not true! Lint is dangerous. If you let it build up too long in the dryer filter, your clothes stay damp."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Hm. Did Drysdale tell you that?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yep. He... talks a lot."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He did. I enjoyed listening to his stories."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/8/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who is Drysdale?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/8/c-0/7 kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/8/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Yes. He is voluble, to say the least."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/8/c-0/15 kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/8/c-1/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I also appreciate his extraordinary physical fitness."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/8/c-2/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "The dryer! Very manly. Vigorous. Strapping even."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/8/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "If he would ever get sincere about violence, I believe he would make an excellent pupil."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/8/g-0/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Alas!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/8/g-0/16
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "He is far too distracted with performing, with accolades. Which is not to say that I don't love those things, too! I do."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/8/g-0/24
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "But they are the rewards for a life well-lived in the arenas of violence. Doing violence. Studying and enjoying violence."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/8/g-0/35
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Tasting and smelling and touching violence."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/8/g-0/43
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Drysdale is... more excited by having muscles than by using them to do something of value."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/8/g-0/51
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "But thats neither here nor there!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/8/g-0/59
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "The point to be made at this moment is not a pleasant one. But since you have attempted to attack me with dryer lint, I fear it is one that must be made..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "A holiday card..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "What is that?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, it's a greeting card my dentist sent me last year. Just haven't thrown it away yet."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's a folded piece of heavy paper with some nice words written on it in sparkly ink."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Marketing."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You keep your weapons handy, then!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Heavy paper... how heavy are we talking..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Terrifying!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Does it have a blade? Or teeth? Or bladed teeth?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "From what is it forged?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Heavy paper."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cardstock. 100lb cover weight."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, it's an e-card."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Paper."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "That sounds too heavy to wield, yet..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/c-2/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You expect me to know what the 'e' stands for?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Eldritch!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/c-2/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Egregious!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/c-2/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Explosive!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/c-2/15/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Electronic... it's not a real card."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/c-2/15/c-3/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You bring a phantom."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I can work with that!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/11
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "What will you do with your unconventional and therefore promising weapon?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/19/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll wave it around in your face until you get distracted and frustrated!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/19/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll fan you with it until you get cold and decide to go home."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/19/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Hmph."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/19/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I must warn you, we are rapidly approaching the frustration point already."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/19/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok. Well... I could read it to you I guess?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/19/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll put it on the ground and hope you walk over it and slip?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/19/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Cold. You know I'm deadly warrior from the frigid wastes of Hell, right?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/19/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ha! Right. Maybe not that."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/19/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Indeed."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/19/c-1/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll slap you in the face with it until you get really annoyed and lose your focus."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/19/c-1/15/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll just hit you with it. Keep it simple."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/19/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "And what makes you think you're going to get close enough to me to hit me with an insult, let alone a piece of paper?!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/19/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "All you'll be doing is waving it around while the point of my handrail impales your sternum!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/19/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Damn, yeah, good point."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/19/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That was graphic."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/19/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Well... Keep trying... it's becoming less likely but it is still possible that you'll come up with something cunning!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/19/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I give up."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/19/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll send this back to my dentist so she can fight for me?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/19/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/8/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Well then."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/19/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/8/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "We come to a difficult moment."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/19/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/8/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "This dentist... she is strong?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/19/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/8/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wealthy?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/19/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Oh, for the love of Loki."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/battlefield/0/c-2/23/g-0/16/g-0/19/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Well! I cannot say you lack daring and creativity!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I believe it is time we come squarely face to faceplate with the facts."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You are bad at violence."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've been trying to tell you that."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's a little harsh?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I am terrible at it. But man, seems like fun!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Y'know, I know a pirate I'd love to hook you up with!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Well. While I am naturally exceptional listener, sometimes even I miss things."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. So now we've cleared that up, I'm gonna go."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's ok."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-0/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It was pretty obvious, honestly."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I hope I wasn't... too forceful."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-0/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "That sentence felt absolutely alien as it exited my mouth."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-0/15/g-0/16
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You aggravate me! You won't be forced, you won't fight and you won't surrender. How discombobulating."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-0/15/g-0/24
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "But! I am adaptable. I am a brilliant adapter, actually!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-0/15/g-0/32
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "So you say what you would like to do, cannot believe I'm letting <i>you</i> decide this, and I will... I will... adapt."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-0/15/g-0/40/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok, let's exercise. I've heard that exercise is good for you!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-0/15/g-0/40/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd love to talk to you for a little while. I'm curious about what your deal is."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-0/15/g-0/40/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Look, just... shut up. I don't care about violence, and I'm really tired of hearing you extol your own virtues."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-0/15/g-0/40/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Ah yes! Any activity that helps you get stronger! Makes you more fit, more prepared to do higher and better and more excellent violence!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-0/15/g-0/40/c-0/18
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Yes yes yes, that is very good for you."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "The world can be harsh! Better you know now than to keep blundering through your existence with horse blinders on."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Blunt, but good advice."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why \"horse\". Why not just \"blinders\"."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Specificity in communication is key."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-1/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I've just had a brilliant idea. I would be very, very happy to help you improve your sorry state."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-1/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Among my other talents, I am a singularly gifted motivational instructor."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-1/15/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow, really? I've never had a personal trainer before!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-1/15/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I appreciate it. Violence just isn't really my thing."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-1/15/g-0/16/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Perhaps it doesn't interest you because you're bad at it! With a bit more skill, you might find great pleasure you hadn't encountered before!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-1/15/g-0/16/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeeeahhh I doubt it. I'd love to hear some more of your stories, though!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-1/15/g-0/16/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bad at it or not, I don't CARE about it. Please stop harping on this!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I must tell you... I find you inspirational."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...huh?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-2/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Keep talking."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-2/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Truly. You recognize you are bad at something."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-2/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Of course, it would be hard NOT to recognize it, with the level of your badness being so high, and the level of your skill being... well."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-2/15/g-0/16
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "And yet you persist! You find joy, your attitude is a shining example of how to attack life with vigor and fortitude and a smile on your face!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-2/15/g-0/24
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "If we had had more of your kind of vim at the battle with Friar Bjartur, we would've beaten him even more soundly!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-2/15/g-0/32/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's the story with this Friar?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-2/15/g-0/32/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey, thanks! I figure the only way to be good at something is to be bad at it first."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-2/15/g-0/32/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "And on you go inspiring, spouting wisdom like some fountain that's also bad at violence."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-2/15/g-0/32/c-1/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I love it!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-2/15/g-0/32/c-1/23
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "But I must ask... your words lead me to a thought that perhaps... you would like to be better at violence?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-2/15/g-0/32/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, absolutely. You call it violence, I call it fitness!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-2/15/g-0/32/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe, yeah! We'll have to start slowly, though... I let you get pretty dusty!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/youre_bad_at_this/0/c-2/15/g-0/32/c-1/31/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Fantastic!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "A pirate, eh?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I've been called the pirate before. It's the accent, I think. And after I plunder and pillage, the land is leaner than before in every sense of the word."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/16
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Who is this pirate you speak of?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "His name is Jacques Pierrot."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He is a rogue, a fearsome and (really bad-tempered) bottle slash pirate."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Difficult to say aloud!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Ah yes!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I know him. Very touchy! Always ready to kill something."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Exactly! I think you two would have a lot of fun together."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Something, anything, everything... he's not picky."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Yeah... I do appreciate his constant vigilance for violence."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "But he is so much smaller. My bear-like attachments dwarf him! It would hardly be an honorable victory for me."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Makes sense, I guess."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't speak that way about my lover!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Hela's bells... if I were to attack him with my spinning flywheel, not only would I shatter his bottle..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-1/c-4/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "But that flamboyantly pink sword would probably end up embedded in the yoga mat!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-1/c-4/23
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "And believe me when I tell you that Dunk would not take kindly to being pierced in that way."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-1/c-4/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ouch!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-1/c-4/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "He may appreciate being pierced in other ways, we all do, of course, and regularly!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-1/c-4/34/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "But not with... a cocktail stick."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "...I wager he tried to kill you? More than once?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-1/c-5/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You'll remember that I refrained from trying to kill you until I had gotten to know you a bit better and decided whether or not killing you truly was the appropriate next step!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Lucky for both of us that in addition to fearsome I am also wise, patient and charming beyond all justice."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-2/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I really hadn't thought about any of that."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-2/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So, that's a no on the set-up, then."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "It is not just violence that matters."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "It is honor. It is honorable challenge."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I must say, I am grateful to you for the opportunity to say so. I live my honor but I don't often speak about it."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Violence without honor... is a hollow, rotting thing. And without challenge, it is ponderous, bloated and futile."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Heimdahl's bridge. Even with words, I am extraordinary."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-3/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can you teach me? How to do violence like you do?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-3/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was just trying to be nice. I guess I really don't get you."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-3/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you have any stories that don't involve fighting?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-3/c-9/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Would you like to? I'm always happy to share my wisdom! And of course my wisdom includes physical as well as philosophical lessons."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-3/c-9/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah... I'm good. I just don't think we see eye-to-eye at all."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/if_jacques/0/g-3/c-9/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All right - give me a philosophical lesson..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories_2/0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Ah, the tale of Friar Bjartur."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories_2/0/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "It is a saga for the ages!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories_2/0/19
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "My people began in a warehouse outside of Hell, Norweg. A proud place, a noble place."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories_2/0/27
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "We had many of those great big garage doors, and shelves that one would need a mechanical lifting machine to reach! We were a fearsome band."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories_2/0/35
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "On every solstice and every equinox, we would all gather to worship our gods, of violence, of sweat and of the air!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories_2/0/43
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "The god Njörðr, the god of wind was our first and most important deity."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories_2/0/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why is wind so important?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories_2/0/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Huh. I would've thought the god of skiing would matter more."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories_2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Wind, the exhaled breath of exertion! Air, that rushes past your hands and feet and face as you fly on my skis into your open future!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories_2/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Ah, Wind. Breath. The original life force!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories_2/0/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Y'know, in ayurvedic medicine, they call it Prana."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories_2/0/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Mm. Yes. That's..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories_2/0/c-0/26/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Ok, I really don't care."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories_2/0/c-0/26/c-0/23
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "May I go on?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories_2/0/c-0/26/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, yeah, sorry. Go for it."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories_2/0/c-0/26/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, I'm feeling inspired... let's fight."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories_2/0/c-0/26/c-0/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Kinda bored of this. I think I'd rather go eat some ice cream and sit on the couch."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories_2/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Ha! I am choosing to take your comment as a joke because if you were truly mocking my religion..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories_2/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I would no longer share this great saga and I would begin to do grievous violence upon you immediately!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories_2/0/c-1/26
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Honestly, either way is fine for me, so just let me know what would work better for you."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories_2/0/c-1/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Story. Definitely story. What happened next??"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories_2/0/c-1/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm bored of violence. I think I'm just gonna go."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/Norse_stories_2/0/c-1/34/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm feeling kinda into violence right now. Show me some stuff!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/4
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "One day, we were ambushed. In a corner of the warehouse, the foreman placed a single box, the harbinger of many to come... each one a knell of doom."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "It was a Fryer, but one who had turned away from the Road to the Heavenly Kitchen. His name was Bjartur, from the faraway land of..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/23
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "...well, not that faraway, he was from the Netherlands but still. If you have to travel there by boat, it feels like a hero's journey!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/31
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "It soon became clear that Bjartur was a heretic! He worshipped oil, a sticky oozy substance that we had before used only to grease our gears. This we did for play and for lovemaking. But never for food!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/39
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "He would dollop the grease on fried potatoes, fish, brussels sprouts, chicken thighs... on one occasion I saw him fry a candy bar in an ecstatic trance, just to prove that he could do it!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/47
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "And he did no violence. Like, ever."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/55
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "He was... and the word sticks in my pulley cables ... a pacifist."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/66/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just to be clear, when you say pacifist, that means he... never exercised. Right?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/66/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Exactly. He just sat there, oozing his precious goo. Be assured; the sheen on his brow was never from good holy sweat!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/66/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Everyday there were more of them. More converts to his sick ritual, more boxes stacked in the corner."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/66/c-0/23
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Finally, we knew that he had to be stopped. It was no longer enough to watch him building his viscous army. Our love of righteous violence was about to be sated!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/66/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is awesome..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/66/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good GOD I'm hungry..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/66/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Awesome indeed..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/66/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Not for anything fried, I trust..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "We attacked! Under cover of night, the single security fluorescent flickering over the emergency exit sign, we crossed the open floor of the warehouse."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "In an homage to irony, the only reason Bjartur and his disgusting devotees did not hear us was because we were so... well-oiled."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Well that and the weak-gutted singing coming from his feast day celebrations."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "He had fried some god-forsaken combination of food and personal hygiene products and his bacchic splendor was leaking all over the concrete."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "We snuck up on him. We surrounded him. And on my signal, a single gentle flick of my flywheel, the music of conquest began!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/g-1/43
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Let it be forever known that violence triumphed over apathy, holy sweat over the unholy slick, driving wind over the trance of stagnation!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/g-1/54/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Holy shit, man. That's freaking awesome."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/g-1/55/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me you had a party after that."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/g-1/c-2/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Our celebrations... oh, friend, our celebrations!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/g-1/c-2/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Let's just say that all the oil left on that concrete floor was finally put to its proper use..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/g-1/c-2/23
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Consensual lubrication of each other's flywheels!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/g-1/c-2/31
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I, as you might imagine, am the single greatest lover my community has ever known..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/g-1/c-2/39
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "And good gravy did I get to work out. Excellent violence, lovemaking. Behind interval training and a good dusting, probably my favorite."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "So, now you have heard a saga, one of the greatest victories of my lifetime."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "How are you feeling? Are you inspired? Enraptured? Transported?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/g-2/24 kristof_crosstrainer/bjarturfriendjoin/0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Let us use the surge of emotion that must surely be pulsing through your atrophied veins!!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/g-2/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel... great. I'm ready to do some violence. Let's go!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/g-2/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, I still don't know if violence is for me, but I'm proud of you!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/story_gather/0/g-2/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm disgusted. I love fried foods! Bjartur did nothing wrong - you monster!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Excellent! Let us begin."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "The first and most important thing for doing violence... ah. For you, I will call it <w> \"exercise\"</w>..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/16
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You have made great strides in declaring yourself willing to learn, I will be magnanimous and meet you halfway!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/24
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "The first thing we must find in 'exercising' is the WHY!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/32
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Let us find your why. Tell me, what is your most powerful reason for wanting to sweat, breathe hard and learn my noble art?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want to feel better."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I not-so-secretly want to be like Keanu Sleeves."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd really love to get a date."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "How perfect! There is no better way."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "We shall jump right to it then... gird your loins!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...my what?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Girded!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Your loins! You know, your nether regions!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Your cable-and-pulleys!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/c-0/23/c-0/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Never mind. Prepare! We are off!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I love to hear that sweet sound of girding..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "...I do not know this reference."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He's a movie star. He's a grade-A badass."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He's this guy that gets mad at people who disrespect him and basically destroys their world using the power of knitted pullovers."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/c-1/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Ah. So I don't know him, but I truly esteem him if he uses violence and exercise to right great wrongs."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/c-1/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I can make you this Keanu Sleeps. On we go!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You mean to make yourself more attractive to a potential mate?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You are spot on!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/c-2/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. One day I'd like to have kids. A family."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/c-2/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Yes yes, many of us desire a mate to facilitate and enjoy procreation. I understand this!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/c-2/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "We \"work out\" to attract a mate, to produce the children to do the child-sized violence because only a child can do the child-sized violence..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/c-2/15/c-1/23
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "They're just the right size!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/c-2/15/c-1/31
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "And then of course some of us do violence... sorry, <w>'exercise'</w>... just for the joy of it."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/c-2/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Prepare to find your joy!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm prepared!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't have a choice, do I?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/g-0/c-4/11
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You will always have a choice."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/love_track/0/g-0/c-4/19
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Goodbye for now. Next time we move!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_one/0/6/b/1
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I'm so happy you've returned! Let us commence our workout adventure!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_one/0/9
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "For your first adventure!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_one/0/17
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You will begin with a twenty minute walk. Big steps! Swing from the shoulders! This is the walk of a victorious conqueror, not a mouse in clown sneakers!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_one/0/25
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Remember to breathe from your belly and feel the energy of the earth and the sky moving through your body and electrifying you."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_one/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay - I'll do my best!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_one/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hm... seems kinda hard."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_one/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You can do it! Don't forget to come back and tell me how it went... I'll have a new mission for you on your return!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/6
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You have returned! How excellent. And just in time... I have been waiting with bated breath to give you your next Violent Versatility Training Session!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/14
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "How was your first Exercise? Did you enjoy it?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah! It was harder than I expected."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It was easy! Gimme another."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't do it yet... I will, though!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Yes! Harder... always harder!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "We train so that we are always as hard as can be!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Ah! This... this I like!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "The empty promise!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I tell you - once you begin training more, you will see there is so much more to do."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I am proud. This is somehow even more meaningful to me than when I teach the little one pound dumbbells."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "They are cute... but I think they would probably make mud pies out of cow poop if I told them to!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You are discerning. You can choose. And you have chosen to continue to come to me for training."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "It... it fills my heart."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/g-0/38
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "We train in many ways. We train physically, we train mentally, and we train in self-belief."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/g-0/46
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Have confidence in yourself, and in your goals. Your faith in movement makes the movement that much better for you!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/g-0/54
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I learned that when I was doing battle once and one of my cables came loose!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/g-0/62
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I so firmly believed that I would still slay my enemy that the cable actually flipped around my head and became my weapon, all on its own!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/g-0/70
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I won that day. And I laughed. Glorious!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/g-0/78
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "For today, we rotate. Are you ready?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/g-0/86/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was born ready."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/g-0/87/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds kinda dirty. Bring it on."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Rotation is vital for our situational awareness. Danger does not come only from the front, but from all sides and from behind us."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Find something heavy in your home, heavy enough to be a moderate challenge but not so heavy that you can't lift it many times."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Place it next to your left foot, and put your feet a little wider than your hips."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Now, ten times, pick up that object, keep facing left as you rise, twist through the center and then bending from the knees, place the object down on the floor next to your right foot."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Take a short break, walk around, envision your next victory..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "And then rest! Just as important as horrific violence!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/g-1/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You got it!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/g-1/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can do the resting part just fine!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_two/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I am so proud of you. You are well on your way to having some beautiful, violent babies. Ah, beginnings!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_three/0/6
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Look at you! You are looking more and more like a Viking everyday!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_three/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I knew it. I can tell!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_three/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is that a good thing?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_three/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Remember of course that when I say Viking, I mean you're looking fearsome. Rippled. You're looking taller, even if you're short."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_three/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You are doing beautifully. In fact, here."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_three/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He holds his hand out to you, offering you a glittering golden ring."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_three/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "This ring was a gift to my father from the Queen of the Collapsible Bookshelves."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_three/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "She and her tribe lived on the far side of our warehouse; we had very friendly relations with them."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_three/0/g-0/35
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Well... After the war."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_three/0/g-0/43
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "The ring was the sealing of the great treaty of peace between our tribes. I want you to have it, in recognition of your dedication and perseverance."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_three/0/g-0/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks, Kristof. That's really kind."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_three/0/g-0/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow. So... does the ring collapse?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_three/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "It is my honor."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_three/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I don't know. Maybe if you bang on it."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_three/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "That's what she said."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_three/0/g-0/c-3/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ha! You know those jokes??"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_three/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "What jokes?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_three/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ah. Right. Never mind."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_three/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "That is what she said."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_three/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "The Queen."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_three/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "About the ring."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_three/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You take your leave."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_four/0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "My good friend. Here is our last workout together, our final violent valentine."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_four/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Valentine?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_four/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Gettin' nostalgic on me there, Kristof?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_four/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Yes. I have, I must admit, developed a deep fondness for you."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_four/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "As I have watched you failing so fantastically, and then learning, and now succeeding, winning so brilliantly..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_four/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I have come to feel... affection."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_four/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I have come to feel that, with violence done together, can also come the gentle and rewarding sensation of..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_four/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Love."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_four/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I believe that I have come to love you. For your hard work. For your truthfulness. For your playfulness."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_four/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "And I thank you, for giving me the opportunity to experience this feeling. As you know, I am an explorer and an adventurer and I will try anything once. Anything."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_four/0/g-0/56
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "But I have never tried love like this. And it is beautiful."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_four/0/g-0/64/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You are very welcome. I... think I love you, too."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_four/0/g-0/65/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ah, hell, Kristof. Now we HAVE to make out."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_four/0/g-0/66/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Woah, you move hella fast! Let's just be friends."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_four/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Good then. Yes. Yes, very good!!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_four/0/g-1/11
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "But first things first. We must move the blood with your final workout!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_four/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "For this workout..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_four/0/g-1/27
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "We will do thirty minutes of whatever the heck we feel like and then move on to the main course!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_four/0/g-1/35
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Have you ever heard of The Viking's Vengeance...?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_four/0/g-1/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "NO... but I CANNOT WAIT..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_four/0/g-1/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me that's a sexy game..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/workout_four/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "All in good time, you fine mug of mead."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/friendship_track/0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I am finally beginning to understand."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/friendship_track/0/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Violence... you just don't enjoy it. It doesn't sing to you. It doesn't make you sing."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/friendship_track/0/16
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Am I correct? Ah, of course I am. I will not pretend that I am not sad."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/friendship_track/0/24
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "The violent arts have brought so much joy and purpose to my life... it's always been my pleasure to share them."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/friendship_track/0/32
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "But! \"Pine\" is best as a tree, not as a mental state! So. We can maybe find other things around which we enjoy sympathy."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/friendship_track/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hell yeah. I'll bet you have some great stories."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/friendship_track/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm good... we don't have to bond, or anything. We're cool."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/friendship_track/0/c-0/11
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Do I ever!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/friendship_track/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Yes, cool. Cool. Yes."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/friendship_track/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I suppose I would prefer the flaming heat of battle or the brutal ice of an endless winter..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/friendship_track/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "But cool. Somewhere in the middle. I can live with it. Your decision is acceptable!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/bjarturfriendjoin/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm feeling inspired to travel to Norway..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/bjarturfriendjoin/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm pumped."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/bjarturfriendjoin/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That was a lot of talking, but I worked out my ear muscles!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/bjarturfriendjoin/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Yes! Hahaha!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/bjarturfriendjoin/0/g-0/8 kristof_crosstrainer/friendship_track_2/43
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You are, and shall remain my friend!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/friendship_track_2/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Ah, I had no idea you knew Hela, our ancient goddess of the dead."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/friendship_track_2/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "To have her name invoked with your declaration of pride..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/friendship_track_2/16
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "It makes pride, already a powerful emotion... even more violent... you do truly honor me!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/friendship_track_2/24
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I have never accepted when someone did not revel in violence the way that I do, but for you, an exception shall be made."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/friendship_track_2/32
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "As is said these days, we shall agree to disagree."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/hate_track/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I do love violence."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/hate_track/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "But this does not mean I do not have feelings."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/hate_track/16
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "In fact, it is quite the opposite! From whence do you imagine springs the passion that must inflame me to generate the violence I so revere??"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/hate_track/24
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "It is because of this free flow of energy throughout my life that I am so emotionally open."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/hate_track/32
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "And that openness has once again opened me to a grievous wound."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/hate_track/40
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You have wounded me."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/hate_track/48
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "We go our separate ways. Count yourself lucky I am allowing you to go instead of chasing you out with your tail between your legs."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/hate_track/90
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Guess you couldn't... work it out?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_return/0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Ah, back for more, eh?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_return/0/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I am a very skilled lover."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_return/0/16/b/1
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You aren't so bad yourself."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_return/0/19/b/1
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Though you, I must say, really melted my glacier..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_return/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's do it!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_return/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want to Realize you, Kristof."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_return/0/24/s/0 kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_friend_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Am I... faster?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "AGAIN!!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_return/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You complete another beautiful rep of loving with Kristof. You finish sweaty, but feeling wonderful."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_return/0/c-2/7 kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_friend_return/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Yes! All that exercise has done you well!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_return/0/c-2/18 kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_friend_return/0/c-2/18
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Enjoy your movement at top speed!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_friend_return/0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You're back. I'm thrilled."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_friend_return/0/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Always good to see a friend."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_friend_return/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good to see you too."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_friend_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Kristof, let's Realize you."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_friend_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "We move!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_friend_return/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You move in unison with your friend Kristof. You finish sweaty, but feeling energized."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Go away."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_hate_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I have returned to do good violence with you. (USE POISE CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_hate_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wanna workout!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_hate_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Excellent! To battle!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_hate_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I do not believe your sincerity."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_hate_return/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You vacation with violence."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_hate_return/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I live here. And I will not have my home defiled by interlopers."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Have you the weaponry for such an expedition?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realize_join/0/8
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Somehow, I think not."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realize_join/0/16
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I don't know precisely what is required, of course... but I don't think you have it."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realize_join/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nice. I actually do, but thanks for the confidence."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realize_join/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Damn. You do know me. I'll get it, stay right there!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realize_join/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Stay? Stay?!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realize_join/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I am a roving, wandering wind of lusty vengeance!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realize_join/0/c-1/26
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I mean, it's also not like I can really go anywhere but don't you DARE tell me to stay."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realize_join/0/c-1/34
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "(I am not a hound.)"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "You've returned! Do I see the shine of new steel about your person?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realize_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yep, I've got everything we need!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realize_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, no, I just thought it would be nice to come back and say hi."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Interesting."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realize_return/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Your silliness has just reminded me..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realize_return/0/c-1/26
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I have not practiced yet today with my two-cabled cleaver."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realize_return/0/c-1/34
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "It can go through a wall in one stroke."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realize_return/0/c-1/42
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Perhaps, if you come back empty-handed again, I can see if it will go through you?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realize_return/0/c-1/50/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Um, got it. Yep. I'll... I'll be back."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realize_return/0/c-1/50/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Violence. Gotta love it. My inspiration is renewed!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I'm scared - do we really think Realization is going on work on someone as fierce as Kristof?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "To battle, Kristof!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realize_begin/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a cross-trainer, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Dear Odin, the power that flows through me!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realized/0/11
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I can just imagine the sensation of doing a workout with these..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realized/0/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Kristof flexes his gigantic biceps..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realized/0/27
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Or these..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realized/0/35
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He lovingly strokes his massive quadriceps..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realized/0/43
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Oh Sweet Valhalla can you even imagine..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realized/0/51
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "His exploratory hands have discovered his own glutes, and the light in his eyes is positively predatory."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realized/0/59
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "What is there for me to conquer?"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realized/0/67
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "What is there out there that would even pose a challenge to a machine as impregnable as this?!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realized/0/78/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Um, well... there's me, you sauce-pot."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_realized/0/79/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can't think of anything, have fun!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_divert/0/3
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "So there is. My oh my, there is indeed you."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_divert/0/11
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Come to me, my violent delight, and let us hope you survive the coming battle!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_divert/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I do expect a few bumps and bruises..."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_divert/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Put 'em up, you big bear... I've got some tricks up my sleeve!"
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_divert/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Kristof puts every last one of those brand new muscles to work as you come together in a union so violent you're amazed the house is still standing when it's all over. But you make sure to do your part, ensuring that you're not the only one who's seeing Valhalla."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_divert/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When the two of you emerge from your sexual decathlon, you are sweaty, a bit bloody, sore... and thoroughly satisfied."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Kristof realized quite quickly that the world of mere physical contest represented an inadequate challenge for his needs."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_join/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He walked onto the local professional football team to great acclaim, and retired three games later, breaking all team records."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_join/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He amassed a total of 7 broken ribs, one dislocated shoulder, three spilled liters of blood and 14 broken or fully ejected teeth. As all of these injuries were visited on other players, the league was quietly relieved to see him go."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_join/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He decided to move into the business world. He became a stockbroker, working locally and internationally."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_join/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Whatever you can imagine of an extreme stockbroker's lifestyle, double it. Triple it. And add just a soupçon of evil. There was much conquering to be done, and Kristof was voracious."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_join/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "In spite of all this, though, he was perhaps best known for his contributions to fashion."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_join/48
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Soon after his Realization, he began to feel quite homesick for his Viking armor of leather and lamellar."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_join/56
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He contacted a local seamstress and together they designed what would become known as the Brynja; a business suit designed to closely mimic the aesthetics and the functionality of a suit of armor."
msgstr ""

#: kristof_crosstrainer/kristof_love_join/64
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The Brynja became de rigueur: required wearing for anyone who fancied themselves a tycoon or even a teeny-coon in business. Kristof conquered the fashion world almost by accident. While he was busy doing what he did best... conquering."
msgstr ""
